No third-party reference datasets are included. Optional reference downloads
are separately licensed and carry attribution and license texts in their own
archives. Use lexdiv_resource_info() to inspect the resources and terms.
The package's MIT license does not apply to those datasets.

The MASC-format example text and annotations are authored examples, not an
extract from MASC. The corpus-stability and corpus-extension directories
contain ldfreq's numerical research summaries, not source corpus texts,
token sequences, participant identifiers or document-level score tables.
Their sources and analysis conditions are described in the metric-selection
guide and the corresponding reproduction scripts in the source repository.
